{"c":[{"name":"20261003T135628Z-a8acf778077d3916","text":"Chrome ignores AXSelectedTextRange writes on web inputs (selection stays 0+0), so the insert fallback is refused there; and caret-fixture's 'activate legacy' cannot take the front from T3 Code, only from apps the eval launched (B15).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T145037Z-c765ed8386dc228d","text":"Evals exec CaretFixture.app, a copy of caret-fixture made by apps/screen-reader/scripts/bundle-fixture.sh: rerun it after every swift build that changes the fixture, or the eval runs the old one (B16 lost two planner cases to an 08:33 bundle).","type":"note"}]}
